<article class="space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-8">
    <header class="space-y-4">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary">
            OnnaSoft · Business technology
        </p>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">
            Why Choose OnnaSoft? Technology Tailored to You, Results Scaled to
            Your Needs
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-gray-500">
            Discover how OnnaSoft helps businesses transform their operations
            through tailored technology solutions, specialized engineering
            expertise, and scalable digital services. From custom software
            development and enterprise automation to cloud infrastructure, data
            engineering, and artificial intelligence, we build technology
            capabilities aligned with your business goals and designed to
