    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Technology That Understands Your Business
        </h2>

        <p>
            Every business has different challenges, objectives, and operational
            requirements. While standard software and off-the-shelf platforms
            can address common needs, growing organizations often require
            solutions that reflect their specific workflows, existing systems,
            and long-term strategies.
        </p>

        <p>
            At OnnaSoft, we believe technology should adapt to your business
            rather than force your organization to adapt to unnecessary
            technical limitations. Understanding your processes, identifying
            operational bottlenecks, and defining measurable objectives are
            essential steps toward building solutions that deliver meaningful
            value.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our approach focuses on aligning technical decisions with business
            priorities. Whether you need to modernize an existing application,
            automate repetitive processes, integrate disconnected systems, or
            develop a new digital product, we help translate your requirements
            into practical technology solutions.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">
            Tailored Solutions for Your Unique Requirements
        </h2>

        <p>
            Businesses rarely operate with identical processes or technology
            environments. Different industries, team structures, customer
            expectations, and regulatory requirements create unique challenges
            that generic solutions may not fully address.
        </p>

        <p>
            OnnaSoft develops technology solutions around your specific needs.
            This can include custom web applications, backend services, frontend
            interfaces, API integrations, enterprise software customization, and
            automated workflows that connect business processes across
            departments.
        </p>

        <p>
            We prioritize understanding the problem before selecting the
            technology. This helps avoid unnecessary complexity, supports better
            architectural decisions, and ensures that the resulting solution
            addresses the operational challenges that matter most to your
            organization.
        </p>

        <p>
            By combining technical implementation with a business-oriented
            perspective, we help organizations build digital capabilities that
            fit their current operations while remaining adaptable to future
            requirements.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
