            everyone remains aligned throughout delivery. These practices also
            make it easier to identify risks, manage changing priorities, and
            evaluate results.
        </p>

        <p>
            Our goal is to help businesses access the capabilities they need
            while maintaining visibility and control over their technology
            decisions.
